1
00:00:00,500 --> 00:00:03,917
What if showing up every day paid you, and paid you more than the people who didn't?

2
00:00:04,667 --> 00:00:06,210
Most fitness goals die in week two.

3
00:00:06,210 --> 00:00:09,122
Badges don't stop that, and betting apps make money when you fail.

4
00:00:09,872 --> 00:00:10,819
Cypher Run flips it.

5
00:00:10,819 --> 00:00:15,132
Everyone puts in a small deposit, walks every day, and every check-in fills one shared bar.

6
00:00:15,882 --> 00:00:16,909
Joining takes one tap.

7
00:00:16,909 --> 00:00:21,348
On testnet the app gets you free test dollars, pays the deposit, and drops you into your round.

8
00:00:24,682 --> 00:00:25,350
Then you walk.

9
00:00:25,350 --> 00:00:28,546
Cypher Run reads today's steps from Apple Health or Health Connect.

10
00:00:28,546 --> 00:00:29,023
Read only.

11
00:00:29,023 --> 00:00:32,267
Pass a thousand steps, check in, and your share updates on the spot.

12
00:00:36,882 --> 00:00:40,820
Your round shows what you'd get if it launched right now, and how every ending plays out.

13
00:00:40,820 --> 00:00:43,032
If the group falls short, your deposit comes back.

14
00:00:45,282 --> 00:00:48,393
When the bar is full, anyone can launch the round's token on Flap.

15
00:00:48,393 --> 00:00:52,871
The prize, half the supply, and the trading fees go to the people who showed up, split by days.

16
00:00:52,871 --> 00:00:58,480
This real testnet round paid eight hundred twenty two, four hundred eleven, and nothing to the member who never walked.

17
00:01:01,482 --> 00:01:02,481
Run it for a marathon.

18
00:01:02,481 --> 00:01:06,887
The race sponsors the pool, runners train for six weeks, and the ones who trained most earn most.

19
00:01:07,637 --> 00:01:08,483
Or a charity walk.

20
00:01:08,483 --> 00:01:13,277
A sponsor funds the pool, supporters walk every day, and members can give what they earn to the cause.

21
00:01:14,027 --> 00:01:15,035
Nobody holds the money.

22
00:01:15,035 --> 00:01:15,560
Not even us.

23
00:01:15,560 --> 00:01:18,234
It's all contracts on BNB Smart Chain, launched through Flap.

24
00:01:18,984 --> 00:01:19,455
Cypher Run.

25
00:01:19,455 --> 00:01:21,810
Show up, and get paid by the people who also showed up.

